  "notes": "Left-header position 3 has no diagram label; the board-render silkscreen beside it reads NC, used as label. Labels use GPIO names with the CircuitPython name first in functions. Underscores in names such as SENSE_V-, 32K_XN and V_NEOI2C are partly hidden by box edges and rendered as underscores like the visible ones (ADC2_CH9). VOLTAGE_MONITOR (GPIO35), BUTTON, NEOPIXEL and NEOPIXEL_I2C_POWER have no pad and were skipped."
